   "shot": "A 35 mm wide from the aisle near the end of the row, looking down it at an angle: a long row of identical operator stations with grey cubicle partitions, beige push-button multi-line phones with blinking line lights and empty grey task chairs. One man, Henrick, a third of the way down the row, seated at his station facing his partition, lifting the phone receiver to answer. The OPERATORS STANDING BY sign hangs from the ceiling over the row. Clean beige walls, fluorescent drop ceiling.",
