   "shot": "A 40 mm medium shot from the aisle a few stations along the row: Henrick seated at his station facing his partition, seen three-quarter from behind, his face in profile as he writes an order on a pad, deadpan. Grey cubicle partitions around his station; the row of empty stations, empty grey task chairs and beige multi-line phones with blinking line lights recedes soft beyond him to screen left. Clean beige walls, fluorescent drop ceiling.",
